                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/10004: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-29T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 29, 1928—2
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>174. Your 399, May 26, 9 p.m. Department approves your action and is gratified
                    over the results.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
